          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oboine Ahabbu nkooku anyebundaliize? Habwokuba anyebundaaliize, tindireeta kabi omu busumi bwe; baitu mutabani we omu businge bwe, nuwe ndireetera akabi.”",
          "type": "text",
